UPDATE companies SET description='BAPKO Metal Inc. is headquartered in Orange, California, and has operated there since its founding in 1978. The company began as a partnership, transitioned to family ownership for 28 years, then to single ownership before becoming 100 % employee‑owned in its 41st year of operation. This ownership structure underpins a family‑centric culture that the firm says drives its growth and financial resilience.

The firm is a self‑performing contractor that fabricates and installs miscellaneous steel and architectural metalwork. Its services span estimating, design‑assist, 3D BIM modeling (using Tekla Structures), laser scanning, project management, and full‑scale production in over 55,000 sq ft of shop and office space across multiple buildings. Two dedicated divisions handle structural steel and high‑end architectural metals such as stainless steel, bronze, aluminum, and glass.

BAPKO works primarily for general contractors throughout California on commercial, healthcare, educational, industrial, hospitality, and sports‑entertainment projects. Notable installations include the Gaylord Pacific Resort & Convention Center in Chula Vista, the Intuit Dome (Clippers Arena) in Inglewood, and the Din Tai Fung restaurant at Downtown Disney in Anaheim.

The company emphasizes its all‑in‑one, self‑perform model as a differentiator, citing proactive project management, rapid turnaround, and the integration of emerging technologies like 3D laser scanning. Employee ownership is presented as a source of financial stability and a commitment to long‑term client relationships.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Estimating", "Design Assist", "Design Build", "BIM Modeling (Tekla Structures)", "3D Laser Scanning", "Project Management", "Structural Steel Fabrication", "Architectural Metal Fabrication", "Installation", "Preconstruction Services", "BIM Coordination", "Material Tracking", "Safety Planning"], "industries": ["Commercial Construction", "Healthcare Construction", "Educational Construction", "Industrial Construction", "Hospitality", "Sports & Entertainment", "Retail"], "materials": ["Steel (various grades)", "Stainless Steel", "Bronze", "Aluminum", "Glass"], "equipment": ["Tekla Structures 3D BIM software", "Lidar 3D laser scanner"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All-in-one self-perform model: estimating, design, fabrication, and installation under one roof", "Employee-owned structure providing financial resilience and long-term focus", "Advanced BIM and 3D laser scanning for constructability verification", "Dedicated architectural metals division for stainless steel, bronze, aluminum, and glass", "Ironworkers Local 433 & 229 for certified field installation"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1978 -> db, /about", "Headquartered in Orange, CA -> db, /about", "Employee-owned since 41st year (2019) -> /about", "Started as partnership, family-owned 28 years -> /about", "Self-performing contractor for miscellaneous steel and architectural metal fabrication and installation -> db, /about", "Facilities: original 13,000 sq ft, expanded to over 55,000 sq ft -> /about", "Services: Estimating, Design Assist, BIM, Laser Scanning, Project Management, Fabrication, Installation 