UPDATE companies SET description='Bauer Fabrication & Art Metal operates from Waterbury, Vermont, as a metal fabricating and machine shop specializing in architectural metal work, custom furniture, and original artwork. The company serves architects, designers, contractors, and homeowners throughout New England and beyond, with installations in New York City, Boston, Florida, Mississippi, California, and the Virgin Islands.

In its Waterbury facility, the team combines traditional hand-and-eye craftsmanship with a patented thermal-spray-and-wire-mesh process branded as Bauer Art Metal. This proprietary method builds freestanding objects by spraying molten metal, enabling sculptural artwork, memorials, and household items such as sinks and cookware that would otherwise require casting. The shop also provides design services and installation, coordinating with other trades when needed.

Clients include Gossens Bachman Architects, which has commissioned complex stairways and custom sinks, and Planeta Design Group of Boston, a long-term collaborator on boundary-pushing projects. Residential customers such as Howard and Linda Awand have received one-of-a-kind garden fences. The firm works across construction, architectural, residential, and art markets, delivering custom stair rails, staircases, furniture, memorials, and decorative objects.

The company distinguishes itself by welcoming challenging, non-repetitive jobs and by integrating its patented thermal-spray technique with conventional fabrication to create unique textures and forms. Its stated intention is to deliver a finish of excellent and uniform quality on every custom piece.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Architectural metal fabrication", "Custom furniture fabrication", "Original artwork creation", "Design services", "Installation services", "Thermal spray and wire mesh fabrication (Bauer Art Metal process)", "Memorial fabrication", "Household object fabrication (sinks, cookware, floral displays)", "Sculptural artwork fabrication", "Custom stair and railing fabrication", "Custom staircase fabrication", "Metal fabrication"], "industries": ["Construction", "Architectural", "Residential", "Art and Design"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Patented thermal-spray-and-wire-mesh process (Bauer Art Metal)", "Design services and installation offered in-house", "Traditional hand-and-eye craftsmanship for uniform finish", "Serves architects, designers, contractors, and homeowners directly", "Installations across multiple states including New York, Boston, Florida, and the Virgin Islands"], "facts_used": ["Location: Waterbury, VT -> /about", "Business type: metal fabricating and machine shop -> /about", "Services: architectural metal work, custom furniture, original artwork -> /", "Patented process: thermal spray and wire mesh (Bauer Art Metal) -> /about", "Design services and installation offered -> /", "Clients: architects, designers, contractors, homeowners -> /about", "Installations in NY, Boston, Florida, Mississippi, California, Virgin Islands -> /about", "Testimonial from Gossens Bachman Architects -> /", "Testimonial from Planeta Design Group -> /about", "Testimonial from Howard & Linda Awand -> /", "Traditional hand-and-eye craftsmanship -> /about", "Company welcomes challenging jobs -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "As a metal fabricating and machine shop serving construction and architectural markets, our clients are architects, designers, contractors and home owners.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bauer-fabrication-art-metal' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Bauman Custom Woodworking is based in Salem, Ohio, and was founded in 1995 by Stuart Bauman. Bauman began woodworking as a hobby, building pieces for friends and neighbors before transitioning to full-time work in 1994 and establishing the company a year later. The shop has served residential clients across Northeast Ohio for nearly three decades.

The company produces custom cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms, and bespoke furniture. Cabinets are built with solid-wood face frames and veneer-core plywood, while doors and drawers use solid lumber. The workflow covers design—using computer-generated 3D renderings—fabrication, finishing, and on-site installation. All work is performed in-house by a team of craftsmen, though the facility size and headcount are not disclosed.

Bauman’s primary customers are homeowners undertaking remodels or new construction, along with general contractors and subcontractors who coordinate kitchen and bath projects. Testimonials reference collaboration with firms such as Creative Construction & Design for demolition and installation and Youngstown Granite & Quartz for countertop fabrication. The business focuses on the residential construction and interior-design sectors in the Northeast Ohio region.

Bauman emphasizes a handcrafted approach, meaning every project is built by its own crew rather than outsourced. The company positions itself as an alternative to factory-standard cabinetry, offering unlimited customization and guiding clients through the design process with 3D visual aids. The founder cites a desire to use his talents to benefit clients and glorify God as the motivating purpose behind the business.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Kitchen cabinet manufacturing", "Bath vanity manufacturing", "Custom furniture manufacturing", "3D design", "Finishing", "Installation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling", "Kitchen and bath", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Solid wood", "Veneer-core plywood", "Cherry wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted construction: every project is built in-house by the company\u2019s own crew", "Fully custom cabinetry without factory-standard limitations", "Computer-generated 3D design for client visualization", "Guidance through the entire design process", "Award-winning design and service (self-reported)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 -> db", "Headquarters in Salem, Ohio -> db", "Founder Stuart Bauman -> /about", "Started as hobby, full-time 1994, company founded 1995 -> /about", "Custom cabinetry for kitchens, baths, custom furniture -> /, /about", "Cabinet construction: solid wood face frames, veneer-core plywood, solid lumber doors/drawers -> /", "Processes: design (3D), build, finishing, installation -> /services, /about", "Serves Northeast Ohio homeowners and contractors -> /about", "Collaboration with Creative Construction & Design and Youngstown Granite & Quartz -> /about", "Handcrafted, custom, not locked into factory standards -> /about", "3D design for visual aid -> /about", "Award-winning Design & Service claim -> /about", "Materials: solid wood, veneer-core plywood, cherry wood -> /, /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We offer custom cabinetry for various rooms in the home. From Kitchen Cabinets, to Bath Vanities to Custom Furniture we are dedicated to providing quality service, quality products and competitive prices.", "founded_year": "1995", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bauman-custom-woodworking' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
