UPDATE companies SET description='The electronic manufacturing service provider operates facilities in Concord, North Carolina, and Richardson, Texas.

The company specializes in printed circuit board assembly (PCBA), design for manufacturability (DFM), new product introduction, final mechanical assembly, functional testing, conformal coating, and logistics management. Its production lines feature Juki RS-1R pick-and-place machines, Juki G-Titan solder paste printers, CyberOptics SPI and AOI systems, Juki iCUBE selective soldering, Seica Pilot V8 flying-probe and in-circuit testers, and humidity-controlled intelligent storage for components. BayaTronics handles prototype through medium-volume runs and draws on a team with 208 years of combined industry experience.

Customers span industrial, instrumentation, transportation, medical device, cable manufacturing, and consumer electronics sectors. The firm serves OEMs and tier‑one contract manufacturers that require domestic, cost‑competitive assembly with full traceability.

BayaTronics emphasizes full transparency in cost and quality, day‑of response to inquiries, quotes within five working days, and a manufacturing cycle tailored to each customer’s schedule. The leadership team’s background includes two Malcolm Baldrige National Quality Award wins, which shaped a culture of continuous improvement and open partnership.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','AS9100 (pursuing)','RoHS compliant']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed Circuit Board Assembly (PCBA)", "Design for Manufacturability (DFM) optimization", "New Product Introduction (NPI) support", "Final mechanical assembly", "Functional testing (customer-supplied or custom fixturing)", "Conformal coating", "Supply chain logistics and global procurement", "Inventory management and material control", "Solder Paste Inspection (SPI)", "Automated Optical Inspection (AOI)", "X-Ray inspection", "Flying probe testing", "In-circuit testing", "Selective soldering", "SMT and through-hole assembly", "Failure analysis and repair/ECO", "Order fulfillment"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Instrumentation", "Transportation", "Medical device", "Cable manufacturing", "Consumer electronics"], "materials": ["Active and passive electronic components", "Printed circuit boards", "Solder paste", "Flux"], "equipment": ["Juki RS-1R (two in-line pick-and-place mounters)", "Juki G-Titan solder paste printer", "CyberOptics SE500 Ultra solder paste inspection", "CyberOptics SQ3000 automated optical inspection", "Juki iCUBE selective soldering system", "Seica Pilot V8 Next Series flying probe / in-circuit tester", "Juki ISM3600 intelligent storage system", "Juki ISM500 intelligent storage system", "Juki reflow ovens (8+2 zones)"], "volume": "Prototype to medium-volume production", "lead_time": "Quotes within 5 working days; manufacturing cycle time tailored to customer needs", "tolerances": "Placement accuracy \u00b135 \u00b5m (CPK \u22651)", "built_on": ["100% US-based manufacturing",