UPDATE companies SET description='Bazen Woodworking operates from Corsica, South Dakota, where founder Steve Bazen turned a lifelong passion for woodworking into a business serving families across the state. With over two decades of hands-on experience, Bazen established the company on principles of quality craftsmanship and direct customer relationships.

The shop produces custom cabinetry and fine woodwork for residential spaces, including kitchens, closet systems, built-in storage, and bathroom vanities. Each project moves through a three-step process: design consultation, handcrafted fabrication in the Corsica workshop, and professional installation. The company has completed more than 150 projects since inception.

Bazen Woodworking serves homeowners throughout South Dakota, with recent projects in Mitchell, Corsica, and Sioux Falls.

The company emphasizes four differentiators: quality craftsmanship using premium materials and time-tested techniques; personal service with Steve Bazen managing every project from start to finish; local expertise in South Dakota building styles and conditions; and meticulous attention to detail in every joint, finish, and measurement.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom kitchen cabinetry", "Closet systems", "Built-in storage", "Bathroom vanities", "Design consultation", "Handcrafted fabrication", "Professional installation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling", "Custom cabinetry"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Direct collaboration with owner Steve Bazen from design through installation", "Custom pieces handcrafted in Corsica, South Dakota workshop", "Over 20 years of woodworking experience", "Quality craftsmanship with premium materials and time-tested techniques", "Local expertise in South Dakota building styles and conditions"], "facts_used": ["Company name and location: Corsica, South Dakota -> db", "Founder Steve Bazen, owner and master craftsman -> /about", "Over 20 years of experience -> /, /about", "150+ projects completed -> /, /about", "Services: custom kitchens, closet systems, built-in storage, bathroom vanities -> /", "Process: consultation & design, crafting, installation -> /", "Workshop located in Corsica, SD -> /about", "Serves families throughout South Dakota -> /about", "Differentiators: quality craftsmanship, personal service, local expertise, attention to detail -> /about", "No salespeople or project managers; work directly with Steve -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Every cabinet, every shelf, every piece of custom woodwork is crafted right here in our Corsica, South Dakota workshop.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "expo