UPDATE companies SET description='Bennett Plastics was founded in 1982 in Paterson, New Jersey, just minutes from New York City. The company began as a family-owned and operated business focused on custom plastic injection molding and has remained under family ownership for over four decades.

Today the firm operates a 36,000-square-foot facility where it produces millions of parts annually. A dedicated team of engineers and technicians manages projects from initial design through full-scale production runs.

Customers rely on Bennett for both prototype development and high-volume production of components used in consumer and industrial applications.

