UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1915 in Berne, Indiana, and now headquartered in Ossian, Indiana, Berne Apparel has remained family-owned for three generations. The company began by producing bib overalls and work shirts for the local farm community, establishing a focus on durable, affordable workwear.

