UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Sky Solar Co was founded in 2012 in Dubuque, Iowa. The company is led by President Barney Grobstick, who brings over three decades of electrical industry experience, including nine years in solar. Grobstick grew a prior electrical contracting business from nine journeymen to one of the Midwest’s largest electrical contractors before steering Blue Sky Solar Co.

