UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Springs Metals operates from Blue Springs, Mississippi, where groundbreaking for its facility took place in 2011. The company is certified by the National Minority Supplier Development Council as a minority-owned business.

The steel processing service center specializes in slitting, blanking, and warehousing of flat-rolled steel. It handles hot-rolled, cold-rolled, and exposed or coated steel products, offering comprehensive processing solutions under one roof.

Primary customers serve the automotive and oil-and-gas sectors.

